      "content": "that seems like a pretty harsh way to look at it. wouldn't that logic basically mean that anyone who doesn't go into total, immediate resistance is just as guilty as the ones running the regime? it feels like you're setting up a standard where there's no middle ground at all, even if the alternative is total chaos or mass violence.",
